            <title>[ZEPPELIN-263] JsonResponse cannot build response from Exception object</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-263</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
